{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"RetryPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrying matters because the buffers are cleared at flush time: without it a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"failed save only ever reaches disk if the user happens to touch the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity again, which is silent data loss. Retrying ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"forever","type":"text"}]},{"text":" matters just as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"much in the other direction — a write that can never succeed (disk full, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model the container can’t encode, a schema mismatch) must not keep the stack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"busy indefinitely. So attempts are bounded, and running out is an event the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app can see rather than a silence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/SQ","doc:\/\/Swidux\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Swidux\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/retrypolicy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:6Swidux11RetryPolicyV","title":"RetryPolicy","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keywor